# Windows kernel/BSOD dumps and raw soak captures from the 2026-05-25
# IR2UFV<->PCF investigation. Kept on disk, never committed: a kernel
# dump is a snapshot of arbitrary memory and this repo is public. A
# `git add -A research/` swept these in once — hence the explicit rules.
*.dmp
research/**/soak-*.pcap
research/**/*.pcap
research/**/*.pcapng
